      "explanation": "The denominator is a difference of squares, so factoring avoids calculating the two large squares separately:\n\\[\n252^2-248^2=(252-248)(252+248)=4\\cdot500=2000.\n\\]\nTherefore\n\\[\n\\frac{1000^2}{252^2-248^2}\n=\\frac{1{,}000{,}000}{2000}\n=\\boxed{500},\n\\]\nwhich is choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{C}}\\).",
